# A PDF form's scripts in the viewer (pdf-scripts.pdf is forms-js.pdf of
# tools/pdf-make-form-tests.py): the document script and open action run
# at open, formats shown; an order typed in, its line totals, subtotal,
# tax and total calculated in /CO order and shown formatted; a keystroke
# filter refusing a letter, another upper-casing what is typed; a range
# refused with the document's alert in a box of the viewer's own; a check
# box showing a hidden field; a reset button; the download with the
# calculated values in it. The page is 400 x 500 at zoom 1.25: a point
# (x, y) of it is at (200 + 1.25 x, 142 + 1.25 (500 - y)).
downloads-folder
resize 900 700
open pdf-scripts.pdf
advance 600 8
assert-value field-32-0 opened yes
assert-value field-17-0 8.0%
click 262 192
type 3
click 375 192
type 19.99
click 262 229
type 2
click 375 229
type 5
click 450 592
advance 600 8
assert-value field-12-0 $59.97
assert-value field-15-0 $10.00
assert-value field-16-0 $69.97
assert-value field-18-0 5,60 €
assert-value field-19-0 $75.57
# Digits only; upper case.
click 300 442
type 1a2
advance 300 4
click 450 442
type abc
advance 300 4
assert-value field-23-0 12
assert-value field-24-0 ABC
# Out of range: refused, the alert shown, the field as it was.
click 600 442
type 150
click 450 592
advance 400 5
assert-text Invalid value: must be greater than or equal to 0
assert-value field-25-0 
assert-text less than or equal to 100.
# The check box shows the hidden field (its tint where the page was white).
assert-pixel 400 480 #ffffff
click 237 492
advance 500 6
assert-pixel 400 480 #dee5ff
# Reset: the digits, the upper-case field and the first quantity emptied,
# the totals after them calculated again.
click 600 492
advance 500 6
assert-value field-23-0 
assert-value field-24-0 
assert-value field-12-0 $0.00
assert-value field-19-0 $10.80
# The download carries the values (pdftotext shows the formatted totals).
click 832 99
advance 400 5
assert-download pdf-scripts.pdf 5000 %%EOF
